# Seeded design canvases: generated from the .dc.html sources beside them by the
# design skill, ~2.5 MB of editor payload each. The sources are the thing worth
# keeping; the canvas is rebuilt from them.
design/*/[a-z]*-*.html

# Local demo run output: records the operator's own Jira site and issue keys.
documentation/demo/demo-kit/jira-created.json

# Rendered presentation video and narration audio: rebuilt by the scripts
# beside them, and too large for git (one passed GitHub's 100 MB limit).
documentation/demo/graph-presentation/**/*.mp4
documentation/demo/graph-presentation/**/*.wav
